The full moon is Luna's warrior phase, when she assumes the visage of
Diana the Huntress, and searches out her enemies.  The Ahroun can call
upon her determination in finding her foes, illuminating any who oppose
her.  Lunes teach this Gift.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:{x  Spend one Gnosis point.  For the remainder of the scene,
