soft glow, as though illuminated by moonlight.  This Gift can be used
to confound powers such as Obfuscate or magic designed to hide the
caster, but only if the target is actively attempting to harm, compete
with, or otherwise foil the Ahroun or her pack.
 
{WOut of Character / Hack and Slash{x
{WSyntax:  {cbeseech 'full moons light'{x
Grants the ability to detect hidden/veiled/unseen mobs within your
level range.  Additionally, denotes mobs with a {Y*{x in the room.
This Gift costs one Gnosis to activate.
~
