{G        Ahroun {W(Rank 3){x
 
A Garou uses this Gift to resist the pull of frenzy, steeling herself
against Rage when too much is at risk to indulge in mindless fury.
There is always a cost, though.  The werewolf must fight against her
anger when the danger is past, risking turning on allies if Rage
overwhelms her.  A boar-spirit teaches this Gift.

