0 ghoulage background_ghoulage ghoul_age age~

Ghouls are not as Immortal as their Vampire Masters, however there are
similar benefits to having Vitae in a ghoul's system.  As long as she
has vampiric Vitae in her, she will not naturally age a single day.
Due to this, many Ghouls live much longer spans than a normal human.
As long as she is fed Vitae regularly, she can potentially live forever.
 
The Ghoul Age background represents how long she has been enthralled
and constantly fed a supply of Vitae.  With an extended time ghouled,
her body learns to metabolize the Vitae more efficiently, effectively
increasing the amount of blood pool she can draw from.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:{x  The following chart details approximately how long you
have been a Ghoul.

{D    X{x       0 -  50 Years
{D    *{x      51 - 100 Years
{D   **{x     101 - 150 Years
{D  ***{x     151 - 200 Years
{D ****{x     201 - 250 Years
{D*****{x     251+ Years
 
{WOut of Character / Hack and Slash{x
The following chart details the bonuses gained at each level.
See helpfile {cghoulage_chart{x for Freebie/Remort requirements.

{D    *{x     +1 Max Blood Point, Clan/Combat Discipline Max 4
{D   **{x     All Disciplines Max 4
{D  ***{x     +1 Max Blood Point, Clan/Combat Discipline Max 5
{D ****{x     All Disciplines Max 5, No longer lose Blood over time
{D*****{x     Chance of Blood slowly regenerating
 
See also:  Ghoulage_Chart
~
