To successfully strike up a dialogue with a target, Charisma +
Etiquette is rolled.  You can only attempt to speak with beings
intelligent enough for conversation (humans, vampires, werewolves,
etc) normally, but certain supernatural players have means of
talking to intelligent animals.  Enemies denoted with [{W!{x] have
something to say, but not all said has importance.  It costs 1
movement to use the {ctalk{x command.
 
