0 teaching~

While Kindred can learn Common Disciplines (Powers that can manifest on
own, inherent in the Vitae) on their own, with no particular effort,
Clan Disciplines are developed after extensive study and refinement
to create.  Some clans have developed a signature Discipline through
trial and error, and the only way to learn another clan's specific
Clan Discipline is to be taught by someone who has mastered it.
 
Both the teacher and student must be ({CIC{x), and actively roleplay the
session teaching the basics of the Discipline to be learned.  The
teacher must have at least a 3 in the Discipline to be taught, and
the student is required to have enough Freebies to cover learning a
new Discipline as normal.
 
