0 trophy_quest~

{YTrophy Quests:{x
 
These are Immortal-run quests using the {ytrophy{x command.  The quests may
vary from simply collecting trophies from specific mobs, to the more
involved 'spelling' quests.  To participate in the 'spelling' type
version, you must collect trophies to spell out each word on the list.

Spell each word using the first letter of any word in your trophy, with
the exception of a/an/and/of/the.  Each trophy can only be used for one
letter.  Multiple trophies of the same mob may be used for different
words or a different letter in the same word.  You need 1 trophy per
letter.
 
Each word must have all of the trophies to be used collected in a bag,
one bag for each word.  Tiw is wandering around Chester, selling bags
perfect for this.
 
The mob/word list, as well as rewards and duration, will be posted by
the Immortals in the News section of your notes.
{R*{WNote:  {xOne entry per character.

{WSee Also:{x  Trophy
~
