0 ravnos~

{RRavnos:{x
Followers of vice and discord, Clan Ravnos's compulsion towards sin
breeds distrust wherever they travel.  Travelers by necessity, they
hurry from city to city, making them ideal traders.  Goods, information,
secrets -- everything has a price, and these vampires know exactly
what to ask in exchange.
 
As a Clan weakness, each member is addicted to sin, in some form or
another.  In the best of times, they are a disjointed unit, and distrust
one another nearly as much as others distrust them.  Because of this
reputation, Ravnos often conceal their lineage in their travels; instead
opting to masquerade as a member of another clan.
 
The dangerous trickery of the Clan is made most manifest in their
Discipline of Chimerstry.  This art allows the Ravnos to conjure illusions
and twist perceptions as an artist would clay.
 
{RClan Disciplines: {yAnimalism Chimerstry Fortitude{x
 
See Also: Vampire Clan Discipline Animalism Chimerstry Fortitude
~
