A thaumaturge using this power siphons vitae from her subject. She need
never come in contact with the subject, blood literally streams out in
a physical torrent from the subject to the Kindred (though it is often
mystically absorbed and need not enter through the mouth).
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
~
