{RBlood of Potency{x
{R        Thaumaturgy {W***{x
 
The thaumaturge gains such control over his own blood that he may
effectively concentrate it, making it more powerful for a short time.
In effect, he may temporarily lower his own Generation with this power.
This power may be used only once per night.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:  {xRoll Willpower.  One success lowers your Generation one step
for one hour.  Each additional success grants either a step down in
Generation or an additional hour.  Diablerie and the Embrace both
ignore Blood of Potency when determining results.
 
{WHack and Slash / Out of Character{x
{WSyntax:  {cpotency{x
Success lowers your Generation for the duration, which effectively
increases your maximum blood pool for the duration.
 
See also: Thaumaturgy Tremere Vitae Generation
~
