{C        Matter {D*{x
 
At the most rudimentary level of the Matter sphere, a Mage begins to
understand the underlying properties of the material world.  Once
she understands the fundamental makeup of an item, she can use that
knowledge to eventually alter matter at her whim.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:  {xWith a successful Effect, the Mage can determine the material
