{G        Red Talon {W(Rank 1){x
 
{WSyntax:  {cbeseech 'wolf at the door' <target>{x
 
Not all Red Talons are indiscriminate murderers of humanity.  Sometimes,
the battle is won by leaving a human alive.  This Gift induces a terrible
dread and unyielding respect for the wilds, and it makes a human afraid of
tamering with them in any way.  Any predatory spirit teaches this Gift.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:  {xRoll Charisma + Primal Urge (difficulty of target's Willpower).
The Garou must make eye contact, and the Gift instills a sense of fear of
the wilderness for one day per success.  Target must roll Willpower to
leave his home, and cannot approach forest or wilderness without spending
a Willpower point.  If he does manage to leave, he loses two dice from
Social and Mental pools.
 
{WHack and Slash / Out of Character{x
{WSyntax:  {cbeseech 'wolf at the door' <target>{x
