{G        Ragabash {W(Rank 1){x
 
The deep snows of winter in much of Europe bring privation at best
and starvation at worst to the unprepared or snowbound.  A Garou
using this Gift can travel or hunt with ease by walking atop the
snow.  A hare-spirit teaches this Gift.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:  {xSpend a Gnosis point to activate, which lasts an entire day.
