Furthering along a Mage's understanding of Life, it allows her to alter
her form more fully.  By reweaving her very Pattern, she may assume the
form of natural beasts, gaining all the benefits and detriments that come
along with such forms.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem: {xWith a successful Arete roll, the Mage can assume the form
