{y       Animal Ken {W**{x
 
{WSyntax:  {csoothe <enemy>{x
 
Through study of the animal world, it is possible to calm even some of
the fiercest beasts.  At this level of knowledge, a beast can be partly
tamed and mollified.  Through calming movements and soft spoken words,
an animal can be brought to manageable means.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem: {xWith a Charisma + Animal Ken roll (Difficulty 6), it is possible
to calm a higher complex beast of the animal kingdom.  Each success can
reduce the successes of the animal's action.
 
