0 examine~

{cSyntax:  {xexamine <object>
By using the {cexamine{x command, you can learn what level requirement
an item has, as well as the different keywords that can be used to
interact with the object.  Additionally, you can determine the general
weight of the item in question.  Finally, the general wear and tear
of an item can be determined, as per below.

Condition:  {DDestroyed  {rCritical  {yDamaged  {gGood  {WPristine{x

{cSyntax:  {wexamine room{x
By examining a room, one can gain a bit of extra information about
the room you are currently in.  You will only be able to discern
basic, obvious information.

{cSyntax:  {wexamine <direction/door>{x
You can also gain additional information about an exit, such as
the potential difficulty of a lock.

See Also:  Look
~
0 rites~

{GRites{x
{W        ({GGarou{W){x

While it is true that the Garou are beings of physical might and
unbridled Rage, they also have a deep connection to the Umbra and the
spirits within.  Using this connection, Garou are aided by Spirits in
performing a variety of Rites in their daily lives.  These mystical
practices range from simple affirmations to powerful boons.  
 
Rites must be performed at a Caern.  If you do not possess the level
of the Rites background needed for the Rite, the Ritemaster of that
Caern will perform it for you, at the cost of a chunk of platinum.

{WSyntax:  {crite <option>{x
