By reaching out and touching Prime energy metaphysically, the Mage
can weave the raw Quintessence into various forms.  One of the more
common uses is to simply direct the raw energy at the Mage's current
target.  This energy strikes at the target's very Pattern, tearing
into it on a base level.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:  {xOn a successful Arete roll, the mage can hurl a bit of
pure quintessential energy, striking directly at a target's Pattern.
This deals aggravated damage.
 
{WOut of Character / Hack and Slash{x
{WSystem:  {xThe Mage shapes the raw Quintessence into a directed
bolt of energy, damaging her target.  On a critical success, the
