{GVisage of Fenris{x
{G       Get of Fenris {W(Rank 1){x
 
The Fenrir appears larger and more fearsome, commanding respect and
cowing foes.  A wolf-spirit teaches this Gift.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:  Player rolls Charisma + Intimidation.  Only one success is
needed to affect non-Garou and Garou of equal rank.  To affect Garou of
higher rank, you need a number of successes equal to twice the difference
of rank between the Garou and the target.  Allies and peers affected by
this Gift see the Fenrir as impressive and noble (-1 difficulty to all
Social rolls).  Foes pause for a moment to summon the resolve necessary
to fight such a monster (lose one from initiaive rating).  Gift lasts
for one scene.
 
