{CLittle Good Death{x
{C        Life {W**{x
 
Life Mages have learned to twist the Patterns of simpler living
organisms.  With a practiced hand, she can cause deformities, or
even death as she rips apart a Pattern.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:  {xOn a successful Arete roll, the Mage can tear a simple Pattern
apart at its base level.  More successes allows greater changes.
 
{WHack and Slash / Out of Character{x
{WSyntax:  {crote 'little good death' <target>{x
This attack rote does damage to living targets.  On a critical success,
it may cause instant death if the target is relative level to you.
~
0 senselife sense_life~

{CSense life{x - Allows you to get information about a target by reading 
their life pattern.

(I.E. - Age, race, HP, Mana, Moves, and Stats.)
