0 perceive_forces~

{CPerceive Forces{x
{C       Forces {W*{x

By attuning yourself to the heat energy of the world, you can view things
through a lens of infravision to detect heat sources of enemies, allowing 
to pinpoint them in the dark.  Enemies that are the same temperature as
their surroundings (cold blooded) do not contrast against the background
enough to be discernable.  (I.  E.  Magick Affect) 
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:{x  A successful roll grants the Mage the ability to see in the
thermal spectrum.  She can then see varying heat signatures in her
surroundings.
 
{WSyntax:  {crote 'perceive forces'{x
On a successful roll, the Mage gains infravision.  She can detect non-
cold-blooded mobs even in darkness.
~
