{RHorrid Reality{x
     {RChimerstry{x {W*****{x
          
The vampire may create illusions and use them to "injure" a victim. Each 
success represents one level of damage. The vampire may announce ahead of
time that she only wishes to inflict a certain amount of damage. A victim
may not be killed in this fashion, but she will still be subject to wound
penalties for as long as she believes herself to be injured. The difficulty
to use this power is 8 if the vampire is inflicting aggravated "damage".
          
            
