0 chimerstry~

{RChimerstry{x
  
Chimerstry is the trademark Discipline of the Ravnos that conjures illusions 
into existence.  Such phantom images are as real as the Cainite's skill allows.
While its origins are lost in myths and half-truths, it is assumed to have been
developed by the Ravnos Antediluvian, and over the centuries has greatly 
contributed to the perception of Ravnos as tricksters and con artists.  Because
Chimerstry works best when targets do not realize they are being deceived by 
illusions most practitioners keep their knowledge of it a secret.  Even then, 
it is not always easy to dismiss the phantoms created by this Discipline even 
when one knows them to be false.  Vampires with levels of Auspex may see 
through the effects of Chimerstry.  
          
{W*{x         Ignis Fatuus        Help {RIgnisFatuus{x
