{W****{x      Permanency          Help {RPermanency{x
{W*****{x     Horrid Reality      Help {RHorridReality{x
           
{WClan{x  
Ravnos{x                        Help {RRavnos{x  
     
{RChimerstry{x is a {WClan {xdisipline and may be 
learned via Roleplaying from another.
~
