nothingness.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:{x The duration of the power is based upon the number of successes the 
vampire rolls using Charisma + Empathy (difficulty of the victim's Humanity or 
Path of Enlightenment score).
 
1 success One Turn
2 successes One Hour
3 successes One Night
4 successes One Week
5 successes One Month 
 
{WOut of Character / Hack and Slash{x
{WSyntax: {cincubuspassion <target> <heighten/dull>{x
Upon spending blood, a Kindred can either heighten or dull her target's
emotions.  Heightening will lower the victim's overall attack power, due
to frenzied carelessness.  Dulling will cause the target to briefly pause
the fight due to being aloof.

See also:  Malkavian, Dementation
