0 dementation_discipline~

{RDementation{x
       
Dementation is a Discipline widely known as the hallmark of the Malkavians. It 
draws on the vampire's own insanity and uses it to achieve profound insights or
inflict madness upon others. Such powers are one of the primary reasons the 
clan is often considered both insightful and very dangerous. It lets the 
vampire pass its insanity on to its victim. It is similar to Dominate but acts 
more as a catalyst rather than a controller.
       
