AWAKEN THE ZULO SHAPE - VICISSITUDE 4
 
The traditional war-form of the changeable Tzimisce voivodes is the zulo shape,
a hideous monstrosity a full eight feet in height, with sickly greenish-gray 
scaled skin and powerful arms tipped with jagged black nails.  A row of spines 
sprouts from the zulo's vertebrae, and the external carapace exudes a 
foul-smelling grease.
 
{WSystem{x:  The zulo shape costs two blood points to awaken.  All Physical 
Attributes increase by 3 but all Social Attributes drop to 0 except when 
dealing with others in the zulo shape. however, a vampire in zulo form trying 
to intimidate someone may substitute Strength for a Social Attribute.  Damage 
inflicted in brawling combat increase by one due to the jagged ridges and bony 
knobs creasing the creature's hands.
 
See also:  Tzimisce, Vicissitude
~
