At this level of Protean, a Kindred becomes the stuff of legends and
shifts her body into a swirling mist.  While in mist form, she becomes
impervious to mundane attacks, however she cannot affect anything directly
in return either.  This power can aid the vampire greatly in infiltration,
escape, or any other myriad of uses.  The effects of fire and sunlight damage
are lessened, and she may travel in the air at a brisk pace, slipping through
cracks and other openings with ease.
 
{WTable Top / Role Play{x
{WSystem:{x  By spending a Blood Point and taking three turns (or three blood
and one turn), the vampire turns herself fully into mist.  Strong winds may
buffet her about, but she may use her Potence rating to resist.
 
{WOut of Character / Hack and Slash{x
{WSystem:  {xBy spending Blood, a vampire turns her form to mist.  She is immune to
