0 elder~

ELDER - RANK 5 GAROU
 
Are at the peak of their abilities as Garou and are extremely strong and 
powerful. They have the respect of all those below them and are the second 
rarest rank among living Garou.
 
Gifts Available: Basic, Intermediate, and Advanced gifts for their Breed, 
Tribe, and Auspice

Maximum Willpower, Gnosis, & Rage: 10

Maximum Traits Per Category: 18

Maximum Level of Rites: Advanced 

Requirements: Must meet certain minimum renown requirements depending on their 
Auspice
 
See also:  Garou, Rank
~
0 athro~

ATHRO - RANK 4 GAROU
These Garou have seen a lot, and they have worked hard to gain the respect of 
both the spirits and that nation in order to achieve their rank. These 
individuals are the leaders at septs and are considered the universal teachers 
among the Garou.
 
Gifts Available: Basic and Intermediate gifts for their Breed, Tribe, and Auspice

Maximum Willpower, Gnosis, & Rage: 8

Maximum Traits Per Category: 16

Maximum Level of Rites: Intermediate 

Requirements: Must meet certain minimum renown requirements depending on their 
Auspice

