1 armsoftheabyss~

{RArms of the Abyss{x
{R        Obtenebration {W***{x
    
Beginning at this level of Obtenebration, darkness and shadow take on new and
terrifying properties.  The tendrils summoned by this power, do rise from
the shadows, and darkness of the world, but they are merely the portals.  Here
comes the Abyss and the vampire is now eternally tied to it.  The exact nature
the Abyss is mostly unknown, but all agree it is cold, alien, and.....hungry.
The tentacles summoned by this power have quasi-physical properties, and may
grasp, restrain and constrict foes.  These need not emanate from the same 
source, as long as multiple sources are present and suitable.  Controlling
these arms does not require complete concentration, and as long as the 
Kindred is not incapacitated, she may control tentacles while carrying out
other actions.
                            
