Add {R+1{x Strength / Add {R+1{x Dexterity / Add  {R6{x Feet Additional Length
            
Each tentacle has {R4{x Health Levels, and damage is soaked using the vampire's
{WStamina{x + {WFortitude{x. Aggravated Damage cannot be Soaked in this manner.
Each Tendril has the following combat statistics per combat turn, when
constricting a foe:  Strength {R+1{x Lethal
     
