-1 MAGE~

{CMage{x  
               
All existence in the universe, and the universe itself is composed of Will.
Human minds and souls (called Avatars) believe that water is wet and metal is 
hard, so they are. If a single mind believes differently, it doesn't matter
because it is so over powered by the many others that reality doesn't alter. If
the majority of human kind believes something, it becomes Consensus.
      
Mages are normal everyday people who have discovered this reality, either 
through being taught by a Mentor or by self-discovery. Therefore they have
Awakened their Avatar to the possibilities of the universe.  This awakening
is a powerful thing.  With it a Mage can impose their Will upon the static 
reality that most people believe in... shaping it into whatever form they wish.
     
       
Mage-Related Help Topics 
