-1 CONVERT~

{R****{W  Convert is currently disabled as it is not a part of World of Darkness.{x

CONVERT:
Knowledge in the Sphere of Prime opens the Mage up to other forms of 
accumulating Quintessence and relieving themselves of Paradox.

In game terms, this means you can convert 250 mana into 1 point of 
Quintessence.
Syntax: Convert

You can also use Convert to spend 25 points of Quintessence to rid yourself of 
1 point of Paradox.
Syntax: Convert Paradox

Also help on:
MAGES, MAGICK, TRADITIONS, SPHERES, ARETE, AVATAR, QUINTESSENCE, ROTES, INTRINSICS
