The chart for levels 101-120 are included for the event of a weapons deduction 
level exceeding 100. Under no circumstances should a weapon's base level 
exceed 100.

101. 81d3   106. 83d3   111. 86d3   116. 88d3
102. 81d3   107. 84d3   112. 86d3   117. 89d3
