The formulas used to determine damage values are as follows for each level 
range--

  1 -  20 : level / 2 +  5d3
 21 -  40 : level / 2 + 10d3
 41 -  60 : level / 2 + 15d3
 61 -  80 : level / 2 + 20d3
 81 - 100 : level / 2 + 25d3
101 - 120 : level / 2 + 30d3
 
 
Also help on: DEDUCTIONS 
