     Presence - The Power to Control Emotions 
     Protean{R*{x - The Power to Transform
     Quietus{R*{x - The Power of Silence and Assassination
{x     Serpentis{R*{x - The Power of the Serpent and Blasphemy
     Thaumaturgy{R*{x - The Power of Magic
     Vicissitude{R*{x - The Power of Fleshcrafting 
     
*Clan-Specific Discipline which can only be learned {W({CIC{W) {xthrough
Roleplaying, if it is not one of your clan's starting Disciplines.
See {chelp teaching{x for information on learning Clan Disciplines.
For further help on Disciplines, type {chelp <Discipline Name>{x.
You can see your current Discipline levels, and corresponding powers:
{WSyntax:  {ccs2{x
{c         vampire{x
{W         {cdisclist{x

See also: {WVampire Torpor Nourish Regeneration Bloodpool Generation{x
