0 celerity~

{RCelerity{x
{R       Celerity {W*{x

Many Kindred are known for preternatural speed and grace.  Instances of this are
usually due to the Discipline of Celerity.  By spending vitae, a vampire can
augment herself to move and amazing speeds, both in and out of combat.  This
Discipline's effectiveness increases as the level of Celerity increases, but the
vitae cost also goes up as well.

{WTable Top / Role Play{x
