In combat, she makes a number of additional physical actions equal to her rating
in Celerity.  These actions are only available on the turn following the activation
and are taken at the end of the initiative.

{WHack and Slash / Out of Character{x
{WSyntax:  {ccelerity{x
By spending her blood, the vampire gains a temporary buff which will allow
her the chance of landing additional autoattacks in the middle of combat.  The
number of additional attacks possible is equal to the Celerity rating.

See also:  {WVampire Discipline Combat{x
