{W****{x  Animate Dead (animate <corpse>) Reawaken a dead creature to serve you.
 
{W*****{x Black Death (blackdeath <person>) Instantly Torpors vampires and 
		  kills anything else. Your victim must be weaker than you.
 
See also:  Masque, Blight, Resurrect, Animate, Blackdeath
 
