1 thaumaturgy pathofblood~

{RThaumaturgy{W (Path of Blood){x

Thaumaturgy encompasses blood magic and other sorcerous arts available
to Kindred.  The Tremere created Thaumaturgy by combining mortal wizardry
with the power of vampiric vitae.  Almost every Tremere studies the Path
Blood as her primary path.  This path is based upon manipulation of
Kindred vitae.

Each time the character invokes one of the powers of a Thaumaturgical path,
the thaumaturges player must spend a blood point and make a Willpower roll
against a difficulty equal to the powers level +3. Only one success is
required to invoke a paths effect.

Learning Thaumaturgy also gives access to Thaumaturgical Rituals, up to
the thaumaturge's highest Path level.  Rituals are not currently coded.

