0 vicissitude~

Vicissitude - The Power of Flesh Crafting
 
Vicissitude is the signature power of the Tzimisce and is almost unknown 
outside the clan. Not that the fiends have too many would-be pupils; some 
things are beyond the pale even for the rest of the Damned.
 
Vicissitude is similar in some respects to Protean, but springs from a much 
darker source. Whereas Protean merely enables a Cainite to emulate God's 
creatures, this twisted power allows a Tzimisce to defile and deform those 
creatures (or herself) for all manner of perverse ends. The most beautiful 
maiden or noble stallion can, with but a knead of the fingers and a flick 
of the wrist, be reduced to a hideous freak or a blob of deliquescent pus. The 
Fiends have certainly used Vicissitude's more grotesque side effects to cement 
their infamous reputation.
 
Note that while this Discipline permits powerful and horrific effects, the 
wielder must obtain skin-to-skin contact and must often physically sculpt the 
desired result. This even applies to the use of the power on oneself. Tzimisce 
skilled in Vicissitude are often inhumanly beautiful; those less skilled are 
simply inhuman.
 
{W*{x Malleable Visage (Changeling) One can change their image into that of 
another, an exact duplicate to fool most.
{W**{x Transmogrify the Mortal Clay (fleshcrafting) You have the ability to 
transform a simple canine into a ghoulish hellhound.  The more mastery of this 
discipline you will be able to bring mere humans into Szlachta or Vozhd 
(warghouls).
{W***{x Rend the Osseous Frame (bonecrafting) By bonecrafting yourself you can 
summon forth bony plates and spikes that provide both protection and defensive 
weapon.
{W****{x Awaken the Zulo (horrid form) You can transform your entire body into 
that of a giant beast complete with bone plates, spikes and great strength.
{D  *****{x Inner Essence                      {chelp inneressence{x
{W******{x Chiropteran Marauder (chiropteranmarauder) At this level, you can transform
your body into a giant man-bat, complete with wings and flight.  Additionally, in
this form you may sprout bony wing claws (wingclaw) which give a bonus to unarmed
combat.
 
See also: Malleable Transmogrify Rend Zulo Ascendancy ChiropteranMarauder Tzimisce
 
